    "label": "Act 4, Scene 4",
    "title": "SCENE IV. London. The Palace",
    "location": "London. The Palace",
    "orderInPlay": 17
  },
  "content": [
    {
      "id": "the-third-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth-4-4-stage-001",
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Enter Queen Elizabeth and Rivers."
    },
    {
      "id": "the-third-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth-4-4-speech-001",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "rivers",
        "name": "RIVERS",
        "displayName": "Rivers"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-third-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth-4-4-line-0001",
          "number": 1,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Madam, what makes you in this sudden change?",
          "plainText": "Madam what makes you in this sudden change",
          "lineType": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the-third-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth-4-4-speech-002",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "queen-elizabeth",
        "name": "QUEEN ELIZABETH",
        "displayName": "Queen Elizabeth"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-third-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth-4-4-line-0002",
          "number": 2,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Why, brother Rivers, are you yet to learn",
          "plainText": "Why brother Rivers are you yet to learn",
          "lineType": "verse"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-third-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth-4-4-line-0003",
          "number": 3,
          "speechLineNumber": 2,
          "text": "What late misfortune is befall'n King Edward?",
          "plainText": "What late misfortune is befall'n King Edward",
          "lineType": "verse"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the-third-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth-4-4-speech-003",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "rivers",
        "name": "RIVERS",
        "displayName": "Rivers"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-third-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth-4-4-line-0004",
          "number": 4,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "What, loss of some pitched battle against Warwick?",
          "plainText": "What loss of some pitched battle against Warwick",
          "lineType": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the-third-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth-4-4-speech-004",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "queen-elizabeth",
        "name": "QUEEN ELIZABETH",
        "displayName": "Queen Elizabeth"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-third-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth-4-4-line-0005",
          "number": 5,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "No, but the loss of his own royal person.",
          "plainText": "No but the loss of his own royal person",
          "lineType": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the-third-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth-4-4-speech-005",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "rivers",
        "name": "RIVERS",
        "displayName": "Rivers"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-third-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth-4-4-line-0006",
          "number": 6,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Then is my sovereign slain?",
          "plainText": "Then is my sovereign slain",
          "lineType": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the-third-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth-4-4-speech-006",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "queen-elizabeth",
        "name": "QUEEN ELIZABETH",
        "displayName": "Queen Elizabeth"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-third-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth-4-4-line-0007",
          "number": 7,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Ay, almost slain, for he is taken prisoner,",
          "plainText": "Ay almost slain for he is taken prisoner",
          "lineType": "verse"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-third-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth-4-4-line-0008",
          "number": 8,
          "speechLineNumber": 2,
          "text": "Either betrayed by falsehood of his guard",
          "plainText": "Either betrayed by falsehood of his guard",
          "lineType": "verse"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-third-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth-4-4-line-0009",
          "number": 9,
          "speechLineNumber": 3,
          "text": "Or by his foe surprised at unawares;",
          "plainText": "Or by his foe surprised at unawares",
          "lineType": "verse"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-third-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth-4-4-line-0010",
          "number": 10,
          "speechLineNumber": 4,
          "text": "And, as I further have to understand,",
          "plainText": "And as I further have to understand",
          "lineType": "verse"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-third-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth-4-4-line-0011",
          "number": 11,
          "speechLineNumber": 5,
          "text": "Is new committed to the Bishop of York,",
          "plainText": "Is new committed to the Bishop of York",
          "lineType": "verse"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-third-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth-4-4-line-0012",
          "number": 12,
          "speechLineNumber": 6,
          "text": "Fell Warwick's brother and by that our foe.",
          "plainText": "Fell Warwick's brother and by that our foe",
          "lineType": "verse"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the-third-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth-4-4-speech-007",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "rivers",
        "name": "RIVERS",
        "displayName": "Rivers"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-third-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth-4-4-line-0013",
          "number": 13,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "These news, I must confess, are full of grief;",
          "plainText": "These news I must confess are full of grief",
          "lineType": "verse"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-third-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth-4-4-line-0014",
          "number": 14,
          "speechLineNumber": 2,
          "text": "Yet, gracious madam, bear it as you may.",
          "plainText": "Yet gracious madam bear it as you may",
          "lineType": "verse"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-third-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth-4-4-line-0015",
          "number": 15,
          "speechLineNumber": 3,
          "text": "Warwick may lose that now hath won the day.",
          "plainText": "Warwick may lose that now hath won the day",
          "lineType": "verse"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the-third-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth-4-4-speech-008",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "queen-elizabeth",
        "name": "QUEEN ELIZABETH",
        "displayName": "Queen Elizabeth"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-third-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth-4-4-line-0016",
          "number": 16,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Till then, fair hope must hinder life's decay;",
          "plainText": "Till then fair hope must hinder life's decay",
          "lineType": "verse"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-third-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth-4-4-line-0017",
          "number": 17,
          "speechLineNumber": 2,
          "text": "And I the rather wean me from despair",
          "plainText": "And I the rather wean me from despair",
          "lineType": "verse"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-third-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth-4-4-line-0018",
          "number": 18,
          "speechLineNumber": 3,
          "text": "For love of Edward's offspring in my womb.",
          "plainText": "For love of Edward's offspring in my womb",
          "lineType": "verse"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-third-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth-4-4-line-0019",
          "number": 19,
          "speechLineNumber": 4,
          "text": "This is it that makes me bridle passion",
          "plainText": "This is it that makes me bridle passion",
          "lineType": "verse"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-third-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth-4-4-line-0020",
          "number": 20,
          "speechLineNumber": 5,
          "text": "And bear with mildness my misfortune's cross,",
          "plainText": "And bear with mildness my misfortune's cross",
          "lineType": "verse"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-third-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth-4-4-line-0021",
          "number": 21,
          "speechLineNumber": 6,
          "text": "Ay, ay, for this I draw in many a tear",
          "plainText": "Ay ay for this I draw in many a tear",
          "lineType": "verse"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-third-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth-4-4-line-0022",
          "number": 22,
          "speechLineNumber": 7,
          "text": "And stop the rising of blood-sucking sighs,",
          "plainText": "And stop the rising of bloodsucking sighs",
          "lineType": "verse"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-third-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth-4-4-line-0023",
          "number": 23,
          "speechLineNumber": 8,
          "text": "Lest with my sighs or tears I blast or drown",
          "plainText": "Lest with my sighs or tears I blast or drown",
          "lineType": "verse"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-third-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth-4-4-line-0024",
          "number": 24,
          "speechLineNumber": 9,
          "text": "King Edward's fruit, true heir to th' English crown.",
          "plainText": "King Edward's fruit true heir to th' English crown",
          "lineType": "verse"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the-third-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth-4-4-speech-009",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "rivers",
        "name": "RIVERS",
        "displayName": "Rivers"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-third-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth-4-4-line-0025",
          "number": 25,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "But, madam, where is Warwick then become?",
          "plainText": "But madam where is Warwick then become",
          "lineType": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the-third-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth-4-4-speech-010",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "queen-elizabeth",
        "name": "QUEEN ELIZABETH",
        "displayName": "Queen Elizabeth"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-third-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth-4-4-line-0026",
          "number": 26,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "I am informed that he comes towards London",
          "plainText": "I am informed that he comes towards London",
          "lineType": "verse"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-third-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth-4-4-line-0027",
          "number": 27,
          "speechLineNumber": 2,
          "text": "To set the crown once more on Henry's head.",
          "plainText": "To set the crown once more on Henry's head",
          "lineType": "verse"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-third-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth-4-4-line-0028",
          "number": 28,
          "speechLineNumber": 3,
          "text": "Guess thou the rest: King Edward's friends must down.",
          "plainText": "Guess thou the rest King Edward's friends must down",
          "lineType": "verse"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-third-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth-4-4-line-0029",
          "number": 29,
          "speechLineNumber": 4,
          "text": "But to prevent the tyrant's violence—",
          "plainText": "But to prevent the tyrant's violence",
          "lineType": "verse"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-third-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth-4-4-line-0030",
          "number": 30,
          "speechLineNumber": 5,
          "text": "For trust not him that hath once broken faith—",
          "plainText": "For trust not him that hath once broken faith",
          "lineType": "verse"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-third-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth-4-4-line-0031",
          "number": 31,
          "speechLineNumber": 6,
          "text": "I'll hence forthwith unto the sanctuary",
          "plainText": "I'll hence forthwith unto the sanctuary",
          "lineType": "verse"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-third-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth-4-4-line-0032",
          "number": 32,
          "speechLineNumber": 7,
          "text": "To save at least the heir of Edward's right.",
          "plainText": "To save at least the heir of Edward's right",
          "lineType": "verse"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-third-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth-4-4-line-0033",
          "number": 33,
          "speechLineNumber": 8,
          "text": "There shall I rest secure from force and fraud.",
          "plainText": "There shall I rest secure from force and fraud",
          "lineType": "verse"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-third-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth-4-4-line-0034",
          "number": 34,
          "speechLineNumber": 9,
          "text": "Come, therefore, let us fly while we may fly.",
          "plainText": "Come therefore let us fly while we may fly",
          "lineType": "verse"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-third-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth-4-4-line-0035",
          "number": 35,
          "speechLineNumber": 10,
          "text": "If Warwick take us, we are sure to die.",
          "plainText": "If Warwick take us we are sure to die",
          "lineType": "verse"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the-third-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth-4-4-stage-002",
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "[Exeunt.]"
    }
  ]
}